  "name": "Chromatic Aura",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/holy/barrier-shield-winged-cross.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 11th level, the elements you unleash form an aura around you. While you are surrounded by the elements from Spirit Fist, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You and each creature of your choice within 10 ft of you have resistance to the damage type you chose from Spirit Fist.</li>\n<li>When you take acid, cold, fire, lightning, poison, necrotic, radiant, or thunder damage, you can use your reaction to reduce the damage you take by 1d10 + your Wisdom modifier + your brawler level.</li>\n<li>Once on each of your turns when you hit a target with your unarmed strike, you can deal extra damage to the target equal to your Martial Arts die of the chosen type.</li>\n</ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
